    "description": "The Toho Bank, Ltd. provides various banking products and services in Japan. The company offers general account for individual; specified maturity term, large-scale fixed term, super fixed term, floating interest rate fixed deposits, as well as household expert; investment trust; government bonds; foreign currency deposit list; and financial product intermediation. It also provides mortgage loans; auto, education, financing, advanced medical care, and card loans; unsecured, renovation plan, and secured type free loans; civil servant, doctor, disaster response, and second life support loans; and single-premium whole life/level-premium whole life, medical and caner, education, individual pension, income protection/term, internet-only, home lone fire loans, as well as individual-type defined contribution pension, national pension fund, and inheritance and trust related services. In addition, the company offers funding, administrative rationalization, overseas business support, fund management, management consulting, big advance, and densai services. Further, it provides transfer acceptance, foreign currency exchange, overseas remittance, and safe deposit box; and internet and mobile banking services. The Toho Bank, Ltd. was incorporated in 1941 and is headquartered in Fukushima, Japan."
